cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Logogram in your research, please cite it as below, with the version you used (logogram --version)."
title: "Logogram"
abstract: >-
  A local-first workbench for causal experiments inside language models: activation patching,
  ablation, attribution patching, direct logit attribution, path patching, steering, sets of
  sites and SAE features, with per-prompt statistics and experiment specs that reproduce every
  result.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Logogram contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jeevash23/logogram"
url: "https://github.com/Jeevash23/logogram"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - interpretability
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - activation patching
  - causal intervention
  - language models
  - transformers
